  {
    "RowOffset": 1761202,
    "RowId": 39782,
    "Description": "Render your moogle portrait to life, dealing unaspected damage with a potency of 14,000 to all enemies in a straight line.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Silences</span> target\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>2s\nCan only be cast while under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Moogle Portrait</span>.\n\n※<span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Mog of the Ages</span> changes to <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Retribution of the Madeen</span> while under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Madeen Portrait</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1761726,
    "RowId": 39783,
    "Description": "Render your Madeen portrait to life, dealing unaspected damage with a potency of 16,000 to all enemies in a straight line.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Stun</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>2s\nCan only be cast while under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Madeen Portrait</span>.\n\n※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
